ion/math-academy-id "q-43811" :question/problem "Given that $x,y\\in {C}^{3},$ compute the standard Hermitian inner product $⟨x,y⟩$ of the following two vectors.\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}i \\\\ 2i \\\\ -i\\end{aligned}],\\,y=[\\begin{aligned}1+3i \\\\ -i \\\\ -i\\end{aligned}].\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Using the definition of the standard Hermitian inner product, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y⟩ & ={x}_{1}\\overset{―}{{y}_{1}}+{x}_{2}\\overset{―}{{y}_{2}}+{x}_{3}\\overset{―}{{y}_{3}} \\\\  & =i\\cdot (\\overset{―}{1+3i})+(2i)\\cdot (\\overset{―}{-i})+(-i)\\cdot (\\overset{―}{-i}) \\\\  & =i\\cdot (1-3i)+2i\\cdot i+(-i)\\cdot \\text{i} \\\\  & =(3+i)+(-2)+1 \\\\  & =2+i.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-43811/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "85ae774f-2496-56c0-a800-450bd8383092"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-43811"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-43806/selection/0be5fe3e66d4408b795bf32984fc986004c4546304f35d545668c607647fe221" :answer/id #uuid "d304c970-df1a-5b57-b5df-7de4eb02a4d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43806/selection/d17c1231a58f15a4aec7a4cc5b3add05a7989eb3ebdfbcc43e5f8c92f795de7b" :answer/id #uuid "47f28c12-51f6-512a-989c-7c0f5307b882" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43806/selection/e535deddb7b9dd054f3687e69d37e640349300829cb560a5afb90115e0bbe746" :answer/id #uuid "f5d8e6d8-5687-51cf-a37c-60ea2aa91686" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2i" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43806/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "3c1e1203-7d74-5261-9020-04606cecde28" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-43806/selection/f80535409f78d0e1b5cd0ceb7e72783093e3cde8adf28a5032c83c6dc6b5